 and the Gardiner may not be fully covered.\n\nBefore you drive, check the live [CityNews traffic page](https://toronto.citynews.ca/traffic) or the City of Toronto's road restrictions map. Short-notice closures, such as crashes, wouldn't show up in what I found."}]},"stop_reason":"end_turn","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":541,"cache_read_input_tokens":10825,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1489},"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","refusal_category":null}]}
